    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Good Evening,\nand welcome aboard Alaska Airlines!\nWe hope that you will enjoy our\nmeal service while flying with us\nto Seattle, Nashington\nShortly after takeoff we will begin our Dinner Service.\nTo Begin\nBibb Lettuce with Fresh Tomato and Julienne of\n\"Yelory Bel Pepper. Garnished with, Vegerable \"Crisps\"\nSelection of Warmed Rustic Breads\nA Choice of Entrees\nPesto Crusted Salmon with Classic Bechamel Sauce,\nAnna Potatoes Parmesan, Sugar Snap Peas\nor\nBreast of Chicken Baked in Puff Pastry with Bordelaise Sauce\nWild Rice Pilaf, Buttered Baby Carrots\nDessert offered with coffee\nProudly roasted for Alaska Airlines by\n• is Sends ben Cated\nThank you for choosing to fly with us!\nHaska Airlines\nIADSEA-1 W 01(12/01)"
    ],
